def tool_defs.mail_get_new() -> String:
  String.concat([
    "{\"name\":\"mail_get_new\",\"description\":\"List messages that arrived ",
    "after a checkpoint (UIDVALIDITY + UID), oldest first. Pass back ",
    "next_since_uid and uidvalidity on the next call. Does not use or change ",
    "read/unread state. With MAILBEND_TYPESAFE on, each message also has a ",
    "jev object with Jev's notes (reply_needed, action_required, priority, ",
    "category, suggested_action, and suspected_injection when suspected), ",
    "drawn from untrusted mail content; its status is unchecked when TypeSafe ",
    "failed.\",\"inputSchema\":{\"type\":\"object\",",
    "\"properties\":{\"folder\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Folder ",
    "(IMAP mailbox) name. Default: INBOX.\"},",
    "\"since_uid\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":0,\"description\":\"Last ",
    "UID already processed. Default 0.\"},",
    "\"uidvalidity\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":0,",
    "\"description\":\"UIDVALIDITY from the previous call; required when ",
    "since_uid is set. If it changed, the checkpoint restarts at 0.\"},",
    "\"limit\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":1,\"maximum\":500,",
    "\"description\":\"Default 50.\"},\"projection\":{\"type\":\"string\",",
    "\"enum\":[\"full\",\"text\",\"html\",\"metadata\"],",
    "\"description\":\"Body fields to return; default full preserves text and ",
    "HTML. text omits html, html omits text, metadata omits both. Headers, ",
    "summaries, identity, completeness and Jev stay unchanged. Selected-part ",
    "content follows its MIME type: text keeps text/* except text/html, html ",
    "keeps text/html, metadata omits content. Does not change fetching or Jev ",
    "input.\"},\"max_response_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":1,",
    "\"maximum\":16777216,\"description\":\"Optional UTF-8 byte budget for ",
    "shared result JSON, including JSON escaping; excludes CLI newline and ",
    "MCP envelope/escaping. No default limit. Only body strings are ",
    "shortened; selected binary content is kept whole or replaced by empty ",
    "valid base64, never sliced. Selected-part response.content_complete ",
    "describes returned content; complete remains fetched-part completeness. ",
    "All summaries/cursors/Jev results remain; an impossible budget is an ",
    "error (errors are outside the budget). Retry with a larger budget or ",
    "smaller limit and the same checkpoint. response.output_truncated is ",
    "separate from fetched-message truncated.\"}},\"required\":[],",
    "\"additionalProperties\":false},\"outputSchema\":{\"type\":\"object\",",
    "\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"object\",",
    "\"properties\":{\"error\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},",
